## SuperMemory benchmark results — NEVER COMMIT
# benchmark.py scores a real Trados job, so its outputs carry verbatim
# source and confirmed target text (and the CSV carries every scored
# segment). This repo is public. The script and its README are tracked;
# anything it produces is not.
tools/supermemory_benchmark/*.csv
tools/supermemory_benchmark/*.md
!tools/supermemory_benchmark/README.md

